  "details": "crashes when closing Launch Pad while Japanese IME is actively processing text input.\n\nPlatform: PC (Desktop Mode)\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\n1 Open Launch Pad\n\n2 Begin typing in Japanese using IME\n\n3 While IME is still converting/processing the input (before confirming the text)\n\n4  Close the Launch Pad\n\nExpected Behavior:\n\nThe Launch Pad should close gracefully without affecting the application stability.\n\nActual Behavior:\n\nVRChat crashes immediately when the Launch Pad is closed during active IME processing.",
